                   "json_mode_empty_content":  {
                                                   "question":  "Does official DeepSeek documentation state that JSON Output (response_format json_object) may return empty content, and what handling does it recommend?",
                                                   "finding":  "CONFIRMED. Both the English and Chinese JSON Output guides state that the API may occasionally return empty content when using JSON Output, that DeepSeek is working on it, and that you can try modifying the prompt to mitigate. The guides do NOT document a retry procedure; the word \"retry\" does not appear on either JSON Output page.",
                                                   "evidence":  [
                                                                    {
                                                                        "lang":  "en",
                                                                        "page_file":  "deepseek-json-mode-en.html",
                                                                        "page_title":  "JSON Output | DeepSeek API Docs",
                                                                        "url":  "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/guides/json_mode",
                                                                        "retrieved_at":  "2026-08-11T16:22:47.467Z",
                                                                        "quote_verbatim":  "When using the JSON Output feature, the API may occasionally return empty content. We are actively working on optimizing this issue. You can try modifying the prompt to mitigate such problems.",
                                                                        "context":  "4th bullet under the \"Notice\" section of the JSON Output guide. Preceding bullets: set response_format to {\"type\": \"json_object\"}; include the word \"json\" in the system or user prompt and provide an example JSON format; set max_tokens reasonably to prevent the JSON string from being truncated midway."
                                                                    },
                                                                    {
                                                                        "lang":  "zh",
                                                                        "page_file":  "deepseek-json-mode-zh.html",
                                                                        "page_title":  "JSON Output | DeepSeek API Docs",
                                                                        "url":  "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/guides/json_mode",
                                                                        "retrieved_at":  "2026-08-11T16:22:47.660Z",
                                                                        "quote_verbatim":  "在使用 JSON Output 功能时，API 有概率会返回空的 content。我们正在积极优化该问题，您可以尝试修改 prompt 以缓解此类问题。",
                                                                        "context":  "注意事项（Notice）第 4 条。前几条：将 response_format 参数设为 {\"type\": \"json_object\"}；system 或 user prompt 中必须含有 json 字样并给出 JSON 格式样例；合理设置 max_tokens 参数，防止 JSON 字符串被中途截断。"
                                                                    }
                                                                ],
                                                   "additional_supporting_quote":  {
                                                                                       "lang":  "en",
                                                                                       "page_file":  "deepseek-create-chat-completion-en.html",
                                                                                       "page_title":  "Chat Completions API | DeepSeek API Docs",
                                                                                       "url":  "https://api-docs.deepseek.com/api/create-chat-completion",
                                                                                       "retrieved_at":  "2026-08-11T16:22:48.335Z",
                                                                                       "quote_verbatim":  "Setting to { \"type\": \"json_object\" } enables JSON Output, which guarantees the message the model generates is valid JSON. Important: When using JSON Output, you must also instruct the model to produce JSON yourself via a system or user message. Without this, the model may generate an unending stream of whitespace until the generation reaches the token limit, resulting in a long-running and seemingly \"stuck\" request. Also note that the message content may be partially cut off if finish_reason=\"length\", which indicates the generation exceeded max_tokens or the conversation exceeded the max context length.",
                                                                                       "context":  "response_format parameter description in the Chat Completions API reference."
                                                                                   }
                                               },
                   "thinking_mode_reasoning_content_vs_content":  {
                                                                      "question":  "How does official DeepSeek documentation describe reasoning_content vs final content in thinking mode?",
                                                                      "finding":  "CONFIRMED. In thinking mode the chain-of-thought is returned in reasoning_content (same message level as content), and the final answer is returned in content. reasoning_content is not needed in subsequent context unless a tool call occurred; if passed back without a tool call it is ignored. API reference: reasoning_content is \"For thinking mode only. The reasoning contents of the assistant message, before the final answer.\" Thinking mode is enabled by default (thinking.type default = enabled; effort default = high).",
