                   "retry_recommendation":  {
                                                "question":  "Do the official docs recommend retrying when JSON Output returns empty content?",
                                                "finding":  "NO explicit retry recommendation. The official JSON Output guides recommend: (1) set max_tokens reasonably to avoid truncation, (2) include \"json\" and a JSON example in the prompt, and (3) for the occasional empty content, try modifying the prompt to mitigate. The word \"retry\" does not appear on the JSON Output pages, Thinking Mode pages, FAQ, or the Chat Completions API reference. (Retrying the request is a client-side strategy the docs do not explicitly document.)",
